WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
I have loved "Beauty and the Beast" since I was about 4 years old

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.160
 

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.080
I just fell in love with Belle

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:12.920
She was this feisty young woman who spoke her mind

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:16.260
I know what she meant to me as a young girl

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:19.000
When you love something that much, you really wanna do it justice

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:20.480
It's just amazing

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:31.620
[I want adventure in the great wide somewhere]

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:32.620
Hello?

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:36.000
[I want it more than I can tell]

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:36.900
Come into the light!

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.200
[For once it might be grand]

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.360
What if she is the one?

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:45.000
[To have someone understand]

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:45.800
Pleased to meet you!

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:52.500
[I want so much more than they've got planned]

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.420
Disney's Beauty and the Beast

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:56.360
Rated PG

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.320
(Beauty and the Beast Prologue playing)

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:00.980
Papa?

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.360
Belle, this castle is alive

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.180
(Roar)

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:07.580
Do you wish to take your father's place?

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:08.860
Come into the light!

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:13.540
(Tale as old a time playing)

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:14.120
Hello!

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:15.420
You can talk!

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.240
Well, of COURSE he can talk!

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:18.700
What if she is the one?

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:20.560
The one who'll break the spell?

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:24.500
The master's not as terrible as he appears

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:26.720
I say we kill the beast!

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:28.640
No!

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:31.280
Think of the one thing you've always wanted

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:34.860
And feel it in your heart.

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:38.920
Disney's Beauty and the Beast

